finding the eigenvectors.\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{1}=3,$ we get \n\n$$\nA-{\\lambda }_{1}I=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSo, we get an eigenvector \n${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{2}=-2,$ we get \n\n$$\nA-{\\lambda }_{2}I=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nSo, we get an eigenvector \n${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$\n\nNow, we write down the general solution to the given linear system of differential equations: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={c}_{1}{v}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}+{c}_{2}{v}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t} \\\\  & ={c}_{1}[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{3t}+{c}_{2}[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]{e}^{-2t},\\,{c}_{1},{c}_{2}\\in R\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-327972/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9cfc838b-2e21-5021-8afc-000d12acdf39"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-327972"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-79710/selection/9a9b49ad9d1f2b1fa3e947cf654ce9fc52beb6124a788b1e61122fb50fee9118" :answer/id #uuid "9eea97d7-cc62-5fb4-abf2-4ca9858210bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79710/selection/8fc7a8b07c8e16f4aa481aeee40732f493f209aa0a46a5731ff99f24151c9cdb" :answer/id #uuid "0d711c1a-0e4e-5193-a390-12b390a3c8da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79710/selection/552187ab603309eb8f191c09ec126c431565844ccafff1cd3de8d82f05dff68b" :answer/id #uuid "c3823b39-f9d1-59e4-b3e6-8a6a17d06a4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-79710/selection/228c22097